<view class="page zip-page store-page"><view class="zip-top"><view><view class="zip-title">美妆发现商城</view><view class="zip-sub">更懂你的美妆生活 · 发现适合你的好产品</view></view></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="zip-tabs"><text wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="zip-tab {{active===item?'active':''}}" data-v="{{item}}" bindtap="select">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="duplicate-card soft-card"><image src="/assets/zip/vanity_hero_showcase_1792080326105.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view><text class="ai-badge">AI 提醒</text><text class="strong">你的化妆台里已有 2 件相似产品</text><text class="small">检测到功效相近的产品，建议理性选购。</text><button class="zip-primary" bindtap="buy">查看相似产品</button></view></view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="mall-card soft-card"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="mall-main"><text class="ai-badge">{{item.commercial?'商业合作':'AI 为你补齐'}}</text><text class="strong">{{item.name}}</text><text class="small">{{item.reason}}</text><text class="price">¥{{item.price}}</text></view><button class="zip-secondary" data-item="{{item}}" bindtap="buy">加入购物清单</button></view><bottom-nav active-key="store"/></view>